@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
title Required submission lifecycle retained from Phase 3
[*] --> SUBMITTED : on time upload
[*] --> LATE : late upload
SUBMITTED --> SUBMITTED : resubmit before effective deadline
SUBMITTED --> MARKED : lecturer marks and writes feedback
LATE --> MARKED : lecturer marks with penalty
MARKED --> MODERATED : HoD approves or adjusts
MODERATED --> RELEASED : explicit HoD release
RELEASED --> [*]
note right of MARKED
Required design, not a claim of completion.
Current code uses GRADED and has no
separate RELEASED operation.
CR1 must eventually feed deadline guards.
end note

@enduml
